docs {
  ### Update Gig
  Updates an existing gig. The user must be the seller/owner of the gig.
  Updating the `title` will automatically generate a new unique `slug`.
  
  #### Headers
  - `Authorization: Bearer <token>` (Inherited)
  
  #### Response (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid-string",
      "seller": "uuid-string",
      "title": "Build premium NestJS and React applications",
      "slug": "build-premium-nestjs-and-react-applications-20260624003001",
      "status": "active"
    },
    "message": "Gig updated successfully"
  }
  ```
}
